{"id":"Cb8006ef22f910b4299db","zh":"拟合公式","en":"fitting formula","domain":"轨道不平顺与信号处理","definition_zh":"用于近似表达观测数据或计算关系并估计参数的数学表达式。","definition_en":null,"usage_note":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[{"id":"Ca41906bfc958e45cdfe0","zh":"拟合公式","en":"fitting formula","domain":"车辆轨道随机动力学","group_id":"H137c1b9f2425f4543790","abbreviations":[],"context_label":"车辆轨道随机动力学 · 徐磊等（2018）"},{"id":"Cb8006ef22f910b4299db","zh":"拟合公式","en":"fitting formula","domain":"轨道不平顺与信号处理","group_id":"H137c1b9f2425f4543790","abbreviations":[],"context_label":"轨道不平顺与信号处理 · 陈宪麦等（2016）"}],"designations":[{"id":"De4a5eca90228d46bb974","language":"zh","role":"headword","text":"拟合公式"},{"id":"Dde8a2ad21acf3a9ef513","language":"en","role":"headword","text":"fitting formula"}],"sources":{"P105":{"id":"P105","title":"武广客运专线通用轨道谱及其反演简化算法","authors":"陈宪麦,向尚,徐磊,贺天龙,陈文韬,贾晨","year":"2016","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.2016.02.004","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"陈宪麦等（2016）","overview_slug":"2016-study-on-general-track-spectrum-and-the-simplified-inverse-algorithm-of-wuhan-guangzhou-passenger-sp"}},"complete_examples":[{"id":"S50621509e58392311da4","source_id":"P105","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"en","text":"The general spectrum structure of the upper -lower bound-aries and suggestion spectrum, were established by adopting a new four -parameter fitting formula.","citations":[{"source_id":"P105","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"Sc4da7eefc27f13d197ef","source_id":"P105","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"Journal of Railway Science and Engineering Volume 13 Number 2 February 2016 武广客运专线通用轨道谱及其反演简化算法陈宪麦 1,2,向尚 1,徐磊 3,贺天龙 1,陈文韬 1,贾晨 (1.中南大学土木工程学院,湖南长沙410075; 2.高速铁路建造技术国家工程实验室,湖南长沙410075; 3.西南交通大学牵引动力国家重点实验室,四川成都610031) 摘要: 基于铁路轨道精细化管理的需要,针对武广客运专线2013 年全年的轨道不平顺检测数据进行功率谱密度的计算与统计处理,采用新的4 参数拟合公式,建立武广客运专线上、下界限谱和建议谱的通用谱结构及拟合参数。","citations":[{"source_id":"P105","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"Sbc940aa2119a7b5ef1de","source_id":"P105","page":5,"page_end":5,"language":"zh","text":"图4 为采用铁科院7 参数谱拟合公式与本文拟合公式对武广客运专线某月份左高低不平顺的拟合效果比较,可见本文采用的拟合公式效果较优,并且参数较少,拟合参数见表2。","citations":[{"source_id":"P105","page":5,"page_end":5}]}],"related_terms":[{"id":"C4da328d3dc09ffab5ba3","target_concept_id":"C4da328d3dc09ffab5ba3","target_zh":"高低不平顺","target_en":"vertical profile irregularity","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C720ab37a7daff28ee8fe","target_concept_id":"C720ab37a7daff28ee8fe","target_zh":"上、下界限谱","target_en":"upper-lower boundaries","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C51283259fbd72ffbd411","target_concept_id":"C51283259fbd72ffbd411","target_zh":"功率谱密度","target_en":"power spectral density","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"Cbb5fba1f63ef73131813","target_concept_id":"Cbb5fba1f63ef73131813","target_zh":"通用轨道谱","target_en":"general track spectrum","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"Cf0264deae6244e2cebce","target_concept_id":"Cf0264deae6244e2cebce","target_zh":"高速铁路","target_en":"high -speed railway","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"Cd6d4ea1d7e05aa0361f7","target_concept_id":"Cd6d4ea1d7e05aa0361f7","target_zh":"轨道不平顺","target_en":"track irregularity","label":"同句术语","reason":null}],"suggested_comparisons":[],"relations":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"families":[],"sense_choices":[],"related_sources":[{"id":"P105","title":"武广客运专线通用轨道谱及其反演简化算法","authors":"陈宪麦,向尚,徐磊,贺天龙,陈文韬,贾晨","year":"2016","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.2016.02.004","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"陈宪麦等（2016）","overview_slug":"2016-study-on-general-track-spectrum-and-the-simplified-inverse-algorithm-of-wuhan-guangzhou-passenger-sp"}]}